{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 01:57:44", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-cbdf3945-13b3-4fe2-ae0c-fbedcac22aca', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "requirements_file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/brass_band_achievements_requirements.md",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "project_name": "Brass Band Achievements System"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01M3WstX7GAUwiy8kRr5CEHK', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': 'src/field/ensemble_ui/output/brass_band_achievements_requirements.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01M3WstX7GAUwiy8kRr5CEHK', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# British Brass Band Achievements - Requirements Document\\n\\n## Project Overview\\n\\n**Project Name:** British Brass Band Achievements Expansion  \\n**Project ID:** 29b97d5e  \\n**Created:** 2026-01-14  \\n**Executive Director:** Orchestrating implementation\\n\\n## Vision\\n\\nExpand the existing Ensemble achievements system with a new \\"British Brass Band\\" category inspired by NABBA (North American Brass Band Association) and the British brass band tradition. These achievements celebrate the rich heritage of brass banding including competitions, sections, traditional instrumentation, and contest culture.\\n\\n## Background: NABBA & British Brass Bands\\n\\nNABBA (North American Brass Band Association) promotes British-style brass bands in North America since 1983. Key characteristics:\\n- **Contest Culture**: Championships with adjudicators scoring bands on test pieces\\n- **Section System**: Bands compete in divisions based on ability (Championship, Honor, Challenge, etc.)\\n- **Traditional Instrumentation**: Cornets, flugelhorn, tenor horns, baritones, euphoniums, trombones, tubas, percussion\\n- **Silver Band Tradition**: Many bands carry \\"Silver Band\\" in their name\\n- **Community Focus**: Youth bands, community bands, university bands\\n\\n## Objectives\\n\\n1. **Add New Category**: Create `BRASS_BAND` achievement category (parallel to existing `SKA` category)\\n2. **Achievement Content**: Add 10-15 British brass band themed achievements\\n3. **UI Updates**: Add brass band category to filter dropdown in AchievementsDashboard\\n4. **Maintain Consistency**: Follow existing achievement patterns for rarity, triggers, and points\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n### In Scope\\n\\n**Backend Changes** (`src/runtime/agents/achievements.py`):\\n- Add `BRASS_BAND = \\"brass_band\\"` to `AchievementCategory` enum\\n- Add 10-15 new `Achievement` objects to the `ACHIEVEMENTS` list\\n- Include variety of rarities (common through legendary)\\n\\n**Frontend Changes** (`src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/AchievementsDashboard.jsx`):\\n- Add brass_band category to filter dropdown with icon (\\ud83c\\udfba)\\n- Add brass_band to `getCategoryBadge` function\\n- Update \\"Brass/Band Facts\\" section or add separate fun facts\\n\\n### Out of Scope\\n- New API endpoints (using existing endpoints)\\n- Database schema changes (existing schema supports new category)\\n- New UI components beyond filter updates\\n\\n## Achievement Definitions\\n\\n### Theme Guidelines\\nBritish brass band achievements should reference:\\n- Contest/competition terminology (adjudicator, test piece, draw, sections)\\n- Instrumentation (cornets, euphoniums, tubas, percussion)\\n- Band traditions (Silver Bands, marching, community, youth development)\\n- Famous brass band pieces and composers\\n- Section rankings and promotions\\n- NABBA-specific events and culture\\n\\n### Proposed Achievements (10-15)\\n\\n| ID | Name | Description | Rarity | Points | Icon |\\n|----|------|-------------|--------|--------|------|\\n| `championship_section` | Championship Section | Achieved legendary status with 50+ successful tasks | LEGENDARY | 200 | \\ud83c\\udfc6 |\\n| `silver_band` | Silver Band | First agent to maintain 100% success rate across 5 tasks | RARE | 50 | \\ud83e\\udd48 |\\n| `principal_cornet` | Principal Cornet | Led 3+ sub-agents to successful completion in one task | UNCOMMON | 30 | \\ud83c\\udfba |\\n| `adjudicator` | The Adjudicator | Evaluated and passed judgment on 25+ test results | RARE | 60 | \\ud83d\\udccb |\\n| `test_piece` | Test Piece Mastery | Completed a particularly challenging task (>10 iterations) | UNCOMMON | 25 | \\ud83d\\udcdc |\\n| `bandroom_practice` | Bandroom Practice | Executed 10 tasks total (like rehearsal makes perfect) | COMMON | 15 | \\ud83c\\udfb5 |\\n| `promotion` | Section Promotion | Improved success rate from <50% to >90% | EPIC | 100 | \\u2b06\\ufe0f |\\n| `brass_section_harmony` | Brass Section Harmony | Multiple agents completed tasks simultaneously | RARE | 45 | \\ud83c\\udfb6 |\\n| `march_on_stage` | March on Stage | Completed first task of a new project | COMMON | 10 | \\ud83d\\udeb6 |\\n| `quick_march` | Quick March | Completed a task in under 10 seconds | RARE | 40 | \\u26a1 |\\n| `hymn_tune_encore` | Hymn Tune Encore | Recovered from failure and succeeded (like a well-loved encore) | UNCOMMON | 35 | \\ud83d\\ude4f |\\n| `grand_shield` | Grand Shield | Completed 25 consecutive successful tasks | EPIC | 120 | \\ud83d\\udee1\\ufe0f |\\n| `fanfare` | Fanfare | Triggered 5+ achievements in a single session | RARE | 55 | \\ud83d\\udcef |\\n| `youth_band_graduate` | Youth Band Graduate | New agent class completed its first 10 tasks | UNCOMMON | 20 | \\ud83c\\udf93 |\\n| `national_finals` | National Finals | Participated in project completion (full lifecycle) | LEGENDARY | 150 | \\ud83c\\udfc5 |\\n\\n### Achievement Implementation Details\\n\\n```python\\n# Example achievement definition pattern (for Development Manager reference)\\nAchievement(\\n    id=\\"silver_band\\",\\n    name=\\"Silver Band\\",\\n    description=\\"Maintained 100% success rate across 5 consecutive tasks - polished performance!\\",\\n    category=AchievementCategory.BRASS_BAND,\\n    rarity=AchievementRarity.RARE,\\n    icon=\\"\\ud83e\\udd48\\",\\n    points=50,\\n    agent_classes=[\\"*\\"],\\n    trigger_condition={\\"consecutive_successes\\": {\\"min\\": 5}}\\n)\\n```\\n\\n## Technical Constraints\\n\\n1. **Existing Patterns**: Must follow existing achievement definition pattern\\n2. **Category Enum**: Add to existing `AchievementCategory` enum\\n3. **Frontend Consistency**: Match existing category badge/filter patterns\\n4. **Trigger Conditions**: Use existing trigger condition types where possible\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n\\n1. \\u2705 `BRASS_BAND` category added to `AchievementCategory` enum\\n2. \\u2705 10-15 brass band achievements added to `ACHIEVEMENTS` list\\n3. \\u2705 Frontend filter dropdown includes brass_band with \\ud83c\\udfba icon\\n4. \\u2705 `getCategoryBadge` function handles brass_band category\\n5. \\u2705 All existing tests continue to pass\\n6. \\u2705 Achievements unlock correctly when conditions are met\\n\\n## Implementation Notes\\n\\n### Backend File to Modify\\n- `src/runtime/agents/achievements.py`\\n\\n### Frontend File to Modify\\n- `src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/AchievementsDashboard.jsx`\\n\\n### Testing\\n- Run existing achievement tests to ensure no regressions\\n- Manually verify brass_band filter works in UI\\n- Verify at least one achievement can be triggered\\n\\n## Assumptions Made\\n\\n1. **Icon Choice**: Using \\ud83c\\udfba (trumpet) as primary brass band icon since cornet emoji isn\'t widely available\\n2. **Trigger Conditions**: Reusing existing trigger types (consecutive_successes, total_executions, etc.)\\n3. **Points Balance**: Following existing points range (10-200) based on rarity\\n4. **No New Events**: Not adding new event types to activity tracker\\n\\n## Fun Facts for UI (Optional Enhancement)\\n\\nConsider adding to the fun facts section:\\n> **Did you know?** British-style brass bands date back to the early 1800s and originated in the industrial areas of Northern England. The standard brass band uses 25-30 players on cornets, horns, baritones, euphoniums, trombones, and tubas - no woodwinds allowed! The Black Dyke Band (founded 1855) is one of the oldest and most successful brass bands in the world. NABBA has been bringing this tradition to North America since 1983! \\ud83c\\udfba\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Status:** Requirements Complete - Ready for Implementation  \\n**Next Step:** Delegate to Development Manager for implementation\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01ENisGCFvBkKx7Dvb2f1G7w', 'name': 'git_status', 'input': {'include_history': True, 'history_count': 5}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01ENisGCFvBkKx7Dvb2f1G7w', 'content': '{"success": true, "current_branch": "feature/recovery-continuation", "changes": {"staged": [{"file": "ogs/ensemble-backend.log.1", "status": "M"}], "unstaged": [{"file": "logs/ensemble-backend.log.2", "status": "M"}, {"file": "logs/ensemble-backend.log.3", "status": "M"}, {"file": "logs/ensemble-backend.log.4", "status": "M"}, {"file": "scripts/monitoring/commit_enforcer.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "scripts/monitoring/task_watcher.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/main.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/App.jsx", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/services/api.js", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/frontend_tasks_m1.md", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/runtime/agents/achievements.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/runtime/agents/activity_tracker.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/runtime/agents/runtime.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/runtime/agents/swarm_recovery.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/runtime/agents/swarm_state.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "tests/runtime/agents/test_activity_tracker.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "tests/runtime/agents/test_activity_tracker_cleanup.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "tests/tools/output_organization/test_config.py", "status": "M"}], "untracked": ["src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/PendingReviewDashboard.jsx", "src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/__tests__/", "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/system_architecture_validation.md", "src/frontend/package-lock.json", "src/frontend/package.json", "src/runtime/agents/family_metadata.py", "src/runtime/agents/pending_review_scanner.py", "src/runtime/output_organization/", "tests/runtime/agents/test_pending_review_scanner.py", "tests/runtime/agents/test_pending_reviews.py"]}, "has_changes": true, "clean": false, "ahead": 0, "behind": 0, "last_commit": {"hash": "f61d92e5812759507d6fcb716134ec50844e3381", "message": "Phase 5: Delete dead code and stale planning files", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "41 minutes ago"}, "history": [{"hash": "f61d92e5812759507d6fcb716134ec50844e3381", "message": "Phase 5: Delete dead code and stale planning files", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "41 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "f674cd84dc4679363bad00337e7272bd6c299429", "message": "Phase 3.2 & 4: Iteration tuning system and agent cleanup", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "42 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "6ce994603d87b0c0ecd6aff7670b9beaa9ceafcd", "message": "Phase 3.1: Add fully autonomous mode toggle", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "45 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "f138cce570a5294bc2e739444f54b8a722c48fea", "message": "Phase 2: Enable never-spawning agents via fixed spawn permissions", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "47 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "8af8fc22c93b0fd7c05b4f214bd70b6513e32984", "message": "Phase 1: Critical fixes for agent swarm effectiveness", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "49 minutes ago"}], "stash_count": 0}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Cq82K71hnHUHNNgYBx9FUn', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# Brass Band Achievements System - Milestone Plan\n\n## Project Overview\n**Project Name:** British Brass Band Achievements Expansion  \n**Project ID:** 29b97d5e  \n**Created:** 2026-01-14  \n**Development Manager:** Driving implementation through delivery\n\n## Milestone 1: Core Brass Band Category Implementation\n**Duration:** 1-2 hours  \n**Objective:** Add complete brass band achievements category with backend and frontend integration\n\n### Deliverables:\n1. **Backend Enhancement** (`src/runtime/agents/achievements.py`):\n   - Add `BRASS_BAND = "brass_band"` to `AchievementCategory` enum\n   - Add 10-15 brass band themed achievements to `ACHIEVEMENTS` list\n   - Ensure all achievements follow existing pattern with proper triggers\n\n2. **Frontend Integration** (`src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/AchievementsDashboard.jsx`):\n   - Add brass_band to filter dropdown with 🎺 icon\n   - Update `getCategoryBadge` function to handle brass_band category\n   - Ensure UI displays brass band achievements correctly\n\n3. **Testing & Validation**:\n   - Verify all existing tests pass\n   - Manually test brass band filter functionality\n   - Verify at least one achievement can be triggered\n\n### Acceptance Criteria:\n- ✅ `BRASS_BAND` category exists in enum\n- ✅ 10-15 brass band achievements added with variety of rarities\n- ✅ Frontend filter dropdown includes brass_band option\n- ✅ Brass band achievements display correctly in UI\n- ✅ All existing functionality preserved\n- ✅ No test regressions\n\n### Dependencies:\n- None (expansion of existing system)\n\n### Risk Assessment:\n- **Low Risk**: Adding to existing well-established patterns\n- **Mitigation**: Follow existing achievement patterns exactly\n\n## Milestone 2: Optional Enhancements (Future)\n**Duration:** 1 hour  \n**Objective:** Add polish and additional features\n\n### Potential Deliverables:\n1. **Enhanced Fun Facts**: Add brass band facts to AchievementsDashboard\n2. **Achievement Icons**: Refine icons for better visual appeal\n3. **Additional Achievements**: Add more achievements based on usage patterns\n\n### Note:\nThis milestone may not be needed if Milestone 1 fully satisfies requirements.\n\n## Success Metrics:\n- All achievements working correctly\n- UI seamlessly integrates brass band category\n- No regressions in existing functionality\n- User can filter and view brass band achievements\n\n## Timeline:\n**Total Estimated Duration:** 1-2 hours  \n**Critical Path:** Backend implementation → Frontend integration → Testing\n\n## Resource Allocation:\n- **System Architect**: Architecture review (minimal - extending existing)\n- **Backend Coordinator**: Backend task breakdown and coordination\n- **Frontend Coordinator**: Frontend task breakdown and coordination  \n- **Test Coordinator**: Test planning and validation\n- **TDD Coordinator**: Implementation orchestration'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Cq82K71hnHUHNNgYBx9FUn', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_015741.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_015741.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'t