e summary fields when agent completes\\n- **REQ-2**: Ensure `/api/activity/states` endpoint returns summary, self_analysis, deliverables\\n- **REQ-3**: Maintain backward compatibility with existing API consumers\\n\\n### Frontend UI Updates (Milestone 2)\\n- **REQ-4**: Update App.jsx Agent Tasks section to show summary below completed agents\\n- **REQ-5**: Update ActivityFeed.jsx to show summary in collapsed view for agent_completed activities\\n- **REQ-6**: Display deliverable counts with expand option (e.g., \\"\\ud83d\\udcc1 3 deliverables\\")\\n- **REQ-7**: Show 1-2 sentence summary immediately visible for completed agents\\n\\n### Testing & Validation (Milestone 3)\\n- **REQ-8**: Manual testing with actual agent completions\\n- **REQ-9**: Handle edge cases (missing summary, long text, no deliverables)\\n- **REQ-10**: Ensure no visual regressions in existing UI\\n\\n## Technical Constraints\\n- No breaking changes to existing API behavior\\n- Maintain existing expansion functionality for detailed views\\n- Follow TDD methodology: write tests first, then implementation\\n- Work within existing React/FastAPI architecture\\n\\n## Target Files for Modification\\n- `frontend/src/App.jsx` - Agent Tasks section (~lines 400-460)\\n- `frontend/src/components/ActivityFeed.jsx` - renderActivityDetails function\\n- `src/runtime/agents/activity_tracker.py` - record_agent_completed function\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- Completed agents show summary without requiring clicks\\n- Deliverable counts displayed prominently\\n- Activity feed shows summary preview in collapsed state\\n- Graceful fallback when summary data unavailable\\n- All existing functionality preserved\\n\\n## User Stories\\n1. **As a user**, I want to see what each agent accomplished without clicking expand buttons\\n2. **As a user**, I want to know how many deliverables were created at a glance\\n3. **As a user**, I want agent completion information visible in both the tasks section and activity feed\\n4. **As a user**, I want the system to work gracefully even when agents don\'t provide complete summary data\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n- Major UI redesign beyond the specified changes\\n- Changes to agent execution or completion logic\\n- Additional API endpoints beyond enhancing existing ones\\n- Performance optimizations not directly related to visibility\\n\\n## Assumptions\\n- Existing agent completion data structure is sufficient for enhancement\\n- Current API architecture can accommodate the required changes\\n- React components can be updated without major refactoring\\n- TDD approach will be followed for all implementations\\n\\n## Dependencies\\n- Milestone 1 must complete before Milestone 2\\n- Milestone 2 must complete before Milestone 3\\n- No external dependencies beyond existing project stack"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01HiWcLnQrVNrZxSN1PHTz8i', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# Milestone Plan: Agent Visibility Implementation\n\n## Milestone 1: Backend Data Enhancement\n### Objective\nUpdate backend data tracking to capture and expose agent completion summaries\n\n### Deliverables\n- Enhanced `activity_tracker.py`\n- Updated `/api/activity/states` endpoint\n- Backward compatibility maintained\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- Summary fields extracted and stored\n- API returns summary, self_analysis, deliverables\n- No breaking changes to existing API behavior\n\n## Milestone 2: Frontend UI Updates\n### Objective\nModify frontend components to display agent completion summaries prominently\n\n### Deliverables\n- Updated `App.jsx` Agent Tasks section\n- Updated `ActivityFeed.jsx` with summary preview\n- Deliverable count display\n- 1-2 sentence summary for completed agents\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- Summaries visible without clicking expand\n- Deliverable counts shown\n- Existing UI functi