oject \'Frontend Tasks Implementation\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01AssFB7nJLwYnrAvEP6PBNK', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': 'src/field/ensemble_ui/output/frontend_tasks.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01AssFB7nJLwYnrAvEP6PBNK', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "File not found: src/field/ensemble_ui/output/frontend_tasks.md"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01McVmUfpzSE4oMFkE9Z2zDB', 'name': 'run_command', 'input': {'command': 'find /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble -name "frontend_tasks.md" -type f'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01McVmUfpzSE4oMFkE9Z2zDB', 'content': '{"success": true, "exit_code": 0, "stdout": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/completed/frontend_tasks.md\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend_tasks.md\\n", "stderr": ""}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_014s8B8y1LqtDY21qaDuoYXX', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend_tasks.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_014s8B8y1LqtDY21qaDuoYXX', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Frontend Tasks - Backend Setup and Core Agent Runtime Integration\\n\\n## 1. Base Project Setup\\n- **Task**: Initialize React Project Structure\\n- **Description**: Set up initial React project with TypeScript and Tailwind CSS\\n- **Complexity**: Medium\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  * Project scaffolded with create-react-app\\n  * TypeScript configured\\n  * Tailwind CSS integrated\\n  * Basic project structure matches architecture diagram\\n- **Dependencies**: None\\n\\n## 2. WebSocket Service\\n- **Task**: Implement WebSocket Communication Service\\n- **Description**: Create WebSocket client for real-time agent runtime updates\\n- **Complexity**: Complex\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  * Establishes WebSocket connection\\n  * Handles reconnection logic\\n  * Supports sending/receiving messages\\n  * Provides typed event handlers\\n- **Dependencies**: Base project setup\\n\\n## 3. Problem Submission Form\\n- **Task**: Develop Problem Input Interface\\n- **Description**: Create form for submitting problem descriptions to backend\\n- **Complexity**: Medium\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  * Validates problem input\\n  * Sends POST request to `/api/problems`\\n  * Handles form submission errors\\n  * Responsive design\\n- **Dependencies**: WebSocket Service\\n\\n## 4. Agent Status Context\\n- **Task**: Create Agent Status Management Context\\n- **Description**: Implement React Context for tracking agent execution state\\n- **Complexity**: Medium\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  * Stores agent hierarchy\\n  * Updates in real-time via WebSocket\\n  * Provides methods to query agent status\\n  * Handles error states\\n- **Dependencies**: WebSocket Service\\n\\n## 5. Execution Status Panel\\n- **Task**: Develop Real-Time Execution Tracking Component\\n- **Description**: Create UI component to display current agent execution status\\n- **Complexity**: Complex\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  * Shows dynamic agent hierarchy\\n  * Updates in real-time\\n  * Displays progress and current stage\\n  * Handles error visualization\\n- **Dependencies**: Agent Status Context\\n\\n## 6. Results Display Component\\n- **Task**: Implement Comprehensive Results Presentation\\n- **Description**: Create component to display agent execution results\\n- **Complexity**: Medium\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  * Shows detailed execution results\\n  * Supports different result types\\n  * Professional, clean design\\n  * Error state handling\\n- **Dependencies**: Agent Status Context, WebSocket Service\\n\\n## 7. Error Handling Service\\n- **Task**: Develop Global Error Management\\n- **Description**: Create centralized error handling for frontend\\n- **Complexity**: Simple\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  * Captures and logs frontend errors\\n  * Provides user-friendly error notifications\\n  * Integrates with WebSocket error events\\n- **Dependencies**: WebSocket Service\\n\\n## Task Sequence and Dependencies\\n1. Base Project Setup\\n2. WebSocket Service\\n3. Problem Submission Form\\n4. Agent Status Context\\n5. Execution Status Panel\\n6. Results Display Component\\n7. Error Handling Service"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01RMDFSyvQUWHXVvpx7LEVXU', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_note', 'project_id': '54dede15', 'category': 'general', 'note': 'Requirements found at /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend_tasks.md. Document contains 7 frontend tasks: 1) React setup 2) WebSocket service 3) Problem form 4) Agent context 5) Status panel 6) Results display 7) Error handling. All tasks have clear acceptance criteria and dependency chain.'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01RMDFSyvQUWHXVvpx7LEVXU', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Added note to project"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01AuMZfjDqbWRXRZhmYAYKsS', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'content': '# Frontend Tasks Implementation - Requirements Document\n\n## Project Overview\n**Vision**: Implement the frontend features specified in frontend_tasks.md to create a complete React-based UI for the agent ensemble runtime system.\n\n**Context**: User submitted this request via web UI to implement existing documented frontend tasks using TDD methodology.\n\n## Core Objectives\n1. **Complete Frontend Implementation**: Build all 7 frontend components/services as documented\n2. **TDD Methodology**: Write comprehensive tests first, then implement features\n3. **Real-time Updates**: Enable WebSocket-based real-time agent status updates\n4. **User Experience**: Create intuitive problem submission and result viewing interface\n5. **Error Resilience**: Implement robust error handling throughout the system\n\n## Functional Requirements\n\n### 1. Base Project Setup\n- Initialize React project with TypeScript and Tailwind CSS\n- Configure proper project structure matching architecture\n- Ensure proper development tooling (linting, formatting)\n\n### 2. WebSocket Communication Service  \n- Establish reliable WebSocket connection to backend\n- Implement automatic reconnection logic\n- Provide typed event handlers for agent updates\n- Handle connection state management\n\n### 3. Problem Submission Interface\n- Create responsive form for problem input\n- Validate user input before submission\n- Send POST requests to `/api/problems` endpoint\n- Handle submission errors gracefully\n\n### 4. Agent Status Management\n- Implement React Context for agent state tracking\n- Store and update agent hierarchy in real-time\n- Provide query methods for component access\n- Handle error states appropriately\n\n### 5. Execution Status Panel\n- Display dynamic agent hierarchy visualization\n- Show real-time execution progress\n- Handle multiple concurrent agent executions\n- Visualize error states clearly\n\n### 6. Results Display Component\n- Present comprehensive execution results\n- Support multiple result formats\n- Maintain professional, clean design\n- Handle various result types and error states\n\n### 7. Error Handling Service\n- Centralized error capture and logging\n- User-friendly error notifications\n- Integration with WebSocket error events\n- Graceful degradation on failures\n\n## Technical Requirements\n- **Framework**: React 18+ with TypeScript\n- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS for responsive design\n- **Communication**: WebSocket client for real-time updates\n- **Testing**: Jest + React Testing Library with TDD approach\n- **Code Quality**: ESLint, Prettier, TypeScript strict mode\n\n## Implementation Dependencies\nSequential implementation required following the documented task order:\n1. Base Project Setup → 2. WebSocket Service → 3. Problem Form → 4. Agent Context → 5. Status Panel → 6. Results Display → 7. Error Handling\n\n## Success Criteria\n- All 7 documented tasks implemented with passing tests\n- TDD methodology followed (tests written before implementation)\n- Real-time WebSocket communication functional\n- Complete problem submission to results display workflow\n- Professional UI/UX with responsive design\n- Comprehensive error handling throughout\n\n## Scope Constraints\n- **In Scope**: All tasks documented in frontend_tasks.md\n- **Out of Scope**: Backend modifications, new feature additions beyond documented tasks\n- **Technology Stack**: Fixed to React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS as specified\n\n## Assumptions Made\n- Backend WebSocket and REST API endpoints are functional\n- Development environment supports React 18+ and TypeScript\n- Standard development toolchain available (npm/yarn, Node.js)\n- Testing infrastructure supports Jest and React Testing Library'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01AuMZfjDqbWRXRZhmYAYKsS', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements_20260116_020258.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements_20260116_020258.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_012yVopwSdEsG6xS